adores y `Wake()` volver a activarlos. fileciteturn233file0"},"3770":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales-11","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales#elegir-persistencia","content":"Caso"},"3771":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales-12","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales#elegir-persistencia","content":"Persistente"},"3772":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales-13","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales#elegir-persistencia","content":"Partida temporal de cuatro jugadores"},"3773":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales-14","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales#elegir-persistencia","content":"Normalmente no"},"3774":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales-15","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales#elegir-persistencia","content":"Mundo persistente"},"3775":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales-16","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales#elegir-persistencia","content":"Sí"},"3776":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales-17","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales#elegir-persistencia","content":"Evento que debe desaparecer al terminar"},"3777":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales-18","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales#elegir-persistencia","content":"No"},"3778":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales-19","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/persistencia/canales#elegir-persistencia","content":"Lobby estable"},"3779":{"id":"/